title Parallel Discovery Concurrency Techniques

participant "SelfDiscoveryTest" as Test
participant "CoroutineScope" as Scope
participant "DiscoveryPipeline" as Pipeline
participant "ArtifactWriter" as Writer
participant "CacheStore" as Cache
participant "Cluster Locks" as Locks

note over Test, Locks: === Initialization Phase ===

Test->Pipeline: Initialize discovery
Pipeline->Pipeline: Load shared discovery context\n(architecture, symbols, files)
Pipeline-->Test: Context loaded

note over Test, Locks: === Parallel Cluster Discovery ===

Test->Scope: Create CoroutineScope
Scope->Scope: Launch parallel jobs for each cluster

loop For each cluster
    Scope->Pipeline: discover(clusterId, depth, contracts)
    activate Pipeline
    
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Extract source files
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Build components
    
    Pipeline->Writer: writeArtifacts(clusterId, flows, rules, components)
    activate Writer
    
    Writer->Locks: getClusterLock(clusterId)
    Locks-->Writer: Mutex for cluster
    
    note right of Writer: Cluster-level lock prevents\nconcurrent writes to same cluster
    Writer->Writer: withLock(mutex) {
        Writer->Cache: writeFlow(flow1)
        Cache-->Writer: Success
        Writer->Cache: writeFlow(flow2)
        Cache-->Writer: Success
        Writer->Cache: writeBusinessRule(rule1)
        Cache-->Writer: Success
        Writer->Cache: writeComponent(component1)
        Cache-->Writer: Success
    }
    
    Writer->Locks: Release cluster lock
    Writer-->Pipeline: Artifact references
    deactivate Writer
    
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Collect cluster links\n(in memory buffer)
    note right of Pipeline: Links buffered in memory\nprevents concurrent file corruption
    
    Pipeline-->Scope: PipelineResult
    deactivate Pipeline
end

note over Test, Locks: === Completion Phase ===

Scope->Scope: awaitAll() - wait for all clusters
Scope-->Test: All cluster results

Test->Pipeline: flushLinks()
activate Pipeline
Pipeline->Pipeline: Merge all buffered links
Pipeline->Pipeline: Write links.yaml in single operation
Pipeline-->Test: Links saved
deactivate Pipeline

note over Test, Locks: === Concurrency Safety Summary ===

note right of Locks: **Cluster-Level Locking**\n- Each cluster has its own Mutex\n- Prevents concurrent writes to same cluster\n- Allows parallel writes to different clusters

note right of Pipeline: **In-Memory Link Buffering**\n- Links buffered in memory during discovery\n- Single disk write at end\n- Eliminates concurrent file corruption

note right of Pipeline: **Shared Immutable Context**\n- Architecture detected once at start\n- Shared across all clusters\n- No concurrent modification

note right of Test: **Parallel Coroutine Execution**\n- Each cluster runs in separate coroutine\n- 82% performance improvement\n- 4m 41s vs 26m 51s
